  "description": "There is an `m x n` rectangular island that borders both the Pacific Ocean and Atlantic Ocean. The Pacific borders the top and left, and the Atlantic borders the bottom and right.\n\nReturn a 2D list of grid coordinates `result` where `result[i] = [ri, ci]` denotes that rain water can flow from cell `(ri, ci)` to both the Pacific and Atlantic oceans.",
